unistr('<div class="htmldbInfoBodyP"><code>APP_USER</code>\AC00 \C774 \AC12\ACFC \AC19\C73C\BA74 &PRODUCT_NAME. \C5D4\C9C4\C740 \D604\C7AC \C138\C158\C744 "\ACF5\AC1C \C0AC\C6A9\C790" \C138\C158\C73C\B85C \AC04\C8FC\D569\B2C8\B2E4. &PRODUCT_NAME. \C5D4\C9C4\C740 \B2E4\C74C \B0B4\C7A5 \D45C\C2DC \C870\AC74\C744 \C9C0\C6D0\D569\B2C8\B2E4.</div>'),
